DESCRIPTION:Hi Dheerendar,\n\nLooking forward to our discussion this Friday! Here is the agenda for our condensed 15-minute walkthrough of the Founder Signal System and the Pulse Social app:\n\n1. The Strategy: Founder Signal System overview (3 mins)\n   - How we turn public social signals (LinkedIn) into private sales pipeline (HubSpot Deals/Contacts) autonomously using n8n.\n\n2. The Tech: Pulse Social App live demo (7 mins)\n   - Neo-brutalist social scheduling dashboard.\n   - AI Caption Generation (powered by Claude Sonnet 4.5).\n   - Real-time omnichannel scheduling & engagement simulator.\n\n3. Partner Talk: Global Expansion & India System Integration (5 mins)\n   - Implementing the system for high-growth tech service providers in India.\n\nTalk soon,\nRobert McCarthy\nAgentLab
